    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-iob11">
        <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e98">Caput 11</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e102">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_2@1-3">Nunquid qui multa.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iob11-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-iob11-Nd1e110" ref="#GregoryGreat">Greg.</name> in Job. lib. X.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e114"><seg type="qs">A contumeliis incipit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui nihil putant rectum, nisi quod sentiunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e122">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e124" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_2@8-10">Aut vir verbosus.</quote>
            Vera sententia, quia legitur, <pb ed="#P" n="0787D"/> cultus justitiae silentium, sed non pro loco dicta. Qui nequit recta pati, negligens corrigi, accingit se responsioni.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e131">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e133">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e135">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e137" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_3@1-4">Tibi soli tacebunt homines,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-iob11-Rd1e140"><name xml:id="gom-iob11-Nd1e141" ref="#GregoryGreat">Ibid.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e144">Omnia recta suam irrisionem putat quem remordet conscientia et generaliter dicta sibi aestimat. Unde et contra loqui accenditur, ut vel sic verecundiam regat quasi criminosus non sit, si alios criminetur, unde mentiendo subdit:</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e148">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e150">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e152">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e154" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_4@1-6">Dixisti enim: Purus est sermo meus.</quote>
            Job non dixerat; sed solatio est facinori, si vel falso inquinetur vita corripientis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e159">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e161">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e163">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e165" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_5@1-5">Atque utinam Deus loqueretur tecum,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-iob11-Rd1e168"><name xml:id="gom-iob11-Nd1e169" ref="#GregoryGreat">Ibid.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e172">Perversi verbotenus bona optant, <pb ed="#P" n="0788A"/> ut benigni videantur, et ut, quae in praesenti sunt, mala esse ostendantur, unde et iste dicit:</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e178">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e180" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_5@2-4">Utinam Deus loqueretur.</quote>
            Quasi diceret, tu modo tibi loqueris, dum carnaliter sapis: es vacuus a veritatis spiritu; quasi potius imperitiae tuae compatior, quam poenae:
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e184">
            <ref xml:id="gom-iob11-Rd1e186"><name xml:id="gom-iob11-Nd1e187" ref="#GregoryGreat">Ibid.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e190" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_5@8-8">Labia,</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e193"><seg type="qs">id est judicia, per quae aperta</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">Deo agnoscit: et si peccata agnoscit, patienter flagella tolerat. Et hoc est:</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e203">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e205">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e207">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e209" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_6@12-16">Et intelligeres quod multa minora.</quote>
            Injuste justo iniquitatem objicit, sed haec contumelia de zelo Dei prodit, et est venialis. Merita quoque justi nesciens, ex imperitia irrisionem subdit:
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e214">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e216">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e218">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e220" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_7@1-4">Forsitan vestigia Dei comprehendes.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iob11-Rd1e223"><name xml:id="gom-iob11-Nd1e224" ref="#GregoryGreat">Ibid.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e227"><seg type="qs">Benignitas visitationis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quia ejus essentia a nullo plene videbitur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e236">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e238">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e240">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e242" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_8@1-1">Excelsior.</quote>
            Quia in circumscriptione sui spiritus cuncta transcendit.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e246">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e248" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_8@7-8">Profundior inferno.</quote>
            Quia transcendendo subvehit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e253">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e255">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e257">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e259" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_9@1-2">Longior terra.</quote>
            Quia modum creaturae perennitate aeternitatis excedit
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e263">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e265" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_9@6-7">Latior mari.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e268"><seg type="qs">Quia tempora sic possidet</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">vel temetipsum in tentationibus reprehendere nescis?</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e277">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e279">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e281">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e283" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_10@1-2">Si subverterit.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iob11-Rd1e286"><name xml:id="gom-iob11-Nd1e287" ref="#GregoryGreat">Ibid.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e290"><seg type="qs">Subvertit coelum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ut vel resistens exerceatur, vel seducta frangatur, unde recte dicit:</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e298">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e300" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_10">Quis contradicet ei? vel, quis ei dicere potest cur ita facias?</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Quia judicio Dei nullus potest obsistere, <pb ed="#P" n="0788C"/> vel inquirendo illud penetrare. Cur subvertit vel coarctat?
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e309">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e311">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e313">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e315" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_11@1-3">Ipse enim novit.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iob11-Rd1e318"><name xml:id="gom-iob11-Nd1e319" ref="#GregoryGreat">Ibid.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e322"><seg type="qs">Dum mens elatione attollitur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quo vanitas cum iniquitate pertrahit, ad tumorem scilicet, subdit:</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e332">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e334">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e336">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e338" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_12@1-4">Vir vanus in superbiam.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iob11-Rd1e341"><name xml:id="gom-iob11-Nd1e342" ref="#GregoryGreat">Ibid.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e345"><seg type="qs">Vanus ex culpa redditur audax</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">per effrenatam libertatem audenter vagus per desideria currit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e354">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e356">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e358">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e360" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_13@1-3">Tu autem firmasti.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iob11-Rd1e363"><name xml:id="gom-iob11-Nd1e364" ref="#GregoryGreat">Ibid.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e367"><seg type="qs">Firmari cor non hoc loco</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">hunc velut docendo subjungit: <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e373" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_15@8-10">et eris stabilis,</quote> etc.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e379">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e381">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e383">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e385" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_14@1-2">Si iniquitates.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iob11-Rd1e388"><name xml:id="gom-iob11-Nd1e389" ref="#GregoryGreat">Ibid.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e392"><seg type="qs">Iniquitas in manu</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">si reatus sui conscientia accusat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e401">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e403">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e405">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0788D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e409" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_15@8-10">Et eris stabilis.</quote>
            Quia tanto minus ad judicium trepidat, quanto in bonis actibus solidius stat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e414">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e416">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e418">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e420" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_16@1-2">Miseriae quoque.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iob11-Rd1e423"><name xml:id="gom-iob11-Nd1e424" ref="#GregoryGreat">Ibid.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e427">Mala vitae praesentis tanto durius animus sentit, quanto pensare bonum, quod sequitur, negligit. At si ad ea, quae permanent, oculum cordis figat, nihil esse conspicit quidquid ad finem tendit.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e430">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e432" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_16@4-6">Et quasi aquarum.</quote>
            Quia miseriae, quae transeunt, non vi concutiunt, sed tactum moeroris infundunt, dum extra pro percussione dolet, intus ex tentatione frigescit, contra quod amplius lux divina succenditur, unde subditur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e437">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e439">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e441">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0789A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e445" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_17@1-3">Et quasi meridianus.</quote>
            Fulgor meridianus in vespere est virtutis renovatio in tentatione.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e449">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e451" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_17@9-12">Et cum te consumptum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iob11-Rd1e454"><name xml:id="gom-iob11-Nd1e455" ref="#GregoryGreat">GREG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e458">Cum et per exteriora mala justus occumbere coeperit, tunc claritas ejus incipit: econtra iniqui lumen est in die hujus vitae, obscuritas in vespere.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e461">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e463" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_17@9-12">Et cum te consumptum.</quote>
            Quia foris cadens intus renovatur, et quo duriora tolerat, certius praemia sperat, et hoc est:
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e469">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e471">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e473">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e475" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_18@1-3">Et habebis fiduciam.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e478"><seg type="qs">Defossi secure dormiunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">securus apud se dormit latens ab actibus saeculi.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e487">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e489">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e491">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e493" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_19@1-4">Requiesces et non erit.</quote>
            Qui enim in aeternitatis desiderio figitur, dum nihil est in <pb ed="#P" n="0789B"/> mundo quod appetat, nihil est quod de mundo pertimescat.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e499">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e501" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_19@8-9">Et deprecabuntur.</quote>
            Pravi cum recta praedicant, quod ipsi appetunt, hoc aliis pro magno pollicentur; sed ne diu pollicendo patescat quod sunt, ad rectitudinis citius verba revertuntur, unde subditur:
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iob11-Dd1e506">
          <head xml:id="gom-iob11-Hd1e508">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e510">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e512" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_20@1-3">Oculi autem impiorum.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e515"><seg type="qs">Oculorum nomine</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quo se valeat occultare, non invenit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-iob11-d1e523">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e525" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob11_20@10-13">Et spes illorum abominatio,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-iob11-Rd1e528"><name xml:id="gom-iob11-Nd1e529" ref="#GregoryGreat">Ibid.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iob11-Qd1e532">Quia inde in perpetuum spiritus interit, unde ad tempus caro suaviter vivit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
